                <pb facs="0793" n="723" xml:id="pg723"/>

                <head>No. 454.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr.
                    Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1883-10-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 21,
                    1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Treaty has been signed. Chili has recognized Iglesias as President through her
                    minister for foreign affairs.</p>
                <closer><signed>PHELPS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
